                <h1 class="pi-h1">Own your context.<br>Own your AI.</h1>
                <p class="pi-lede">Self-hosted personal-AI infrastructure. Voice-first. Open source.</p>
                <p class="pi-prose"><strong>Parachute is the substrate every agent and interface should sit on top of.</strong> Your knowledge graph, your transcription, your auth &mdash; on your machine, talking to whatever AI you want, on your terms.</p>
                <div class="pi-img">
